     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">hi everyone,</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">I have a text file  (attached) for several sites: &quot;mod&quot; with other variables.</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">I use this code to do a scatter plot:</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">md=read.table(&quot;C:\\\\data.txt&quot;)</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">ta=md$mod</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">plot(md$grh,md$ref,main=&quot;&quot;,ylab = &quot; &quot;, xlab = &quot;&quot;, pch=c(1:11), col=rainbow(11),cex=2)</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">legend(&quot;topright&quot;, legend = ta,pch=c(1:11), col=rainbow(11),cex=0.90)</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">But I need to do this:</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">1- use filled symbols for sites with &quot;sig&quot; &gt;0.05 and unfilled symbols for the sites with &quot;sig&quot; &lt;0.05</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Any hints on this?</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Thanks</div></div>"
